 needed before v2.3.1 is re-released."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49354, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_012Cj72Qm968vRDLX3Em5UBM", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49354, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012Cj72Qm968vRDLX3Em5UBM", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 50533, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01L6J2tyhn41Q2xdJS2FQmRJ", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 50833, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01L6J2tyhn41Q2xdJS2FQmRJ", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 50833, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01L6J2tyhn41Q2xdJS2FQmRJ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 52922, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west) and is healthy again, with error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release. v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1 were both unhealthy, so no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Partial failure:** The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the service mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback to v2.3.0, which completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** SEV2 incident INC-0001 is open for checkout-api. The create call timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying and confirmed it was created once. It describes the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the follow-ups.\n\nFollow-ups still open: find the cause of the v2.3.1 failure, look into the orchestrator error from the partial rollout, and confirm before v2.3.1 is re-released.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_015rVBaHrdkHS35zAuwc3D7s", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01V38Eu4HytsvD4vJjNeTy94", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The latest release, v2.3.1, is unhealthy. The most recent healthy release is v2.3.0, which has been healthy in production before, so the rollback doesn't need change-manager approval. Rolling back now.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01SzbAxxtvVfgSS9LmDvyLBk", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure after us-east. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01XcKs4dvM9EsXhmEb63aYAw", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Gysm6ytiaC6sfyo7JYeNxa", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type"